# AI Foundations

This folder contains foundational concepts, research, notes, and assignments related to Artificial Intelligence (AI), Machine Learning (ML), Deep Learning (DL), and Large Language Models (LLMs).

## Topics Covered

- Introduction to Artificial Intelligence (AI)
- Machine Learning (ML) Fundamentals
- Deep Learning (DL) Fundamentals
- AI vs ML vs DL
- AI Engineer vs ML Engineer vs DL Engineer
- Introduction to Large Language Models (LLMs)
- Generative AI Basics
- AI Terminology and Concepts

## Purpose

The objective of this section is to build a strong understanding of core AI concepts before moving to advanced topics such as Prompt Engineering, AI Testing, AI Agents, MCP, and AI-powered Automation.

## Tasks and Assignments

This folder includes research documents, learning exercises, assignments, and practical activities completed as part of the AI-Driven Testing learning journey.
